rom all 0.1.x versions are incompatible with this update. You’ll need to start a new game. I’m sorry for the disruption, and thank you for your understanding.What’s new and improvedBusiness calendar, festivals, and events. Keep an eye on upcoming events tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T06:30:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688170","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4971710-1842846814453341","game_id":"steam-4971710","kind":"update","title":"Upcoming Demo Update — Save Compatibility Notice","summary":"Hi everyone!I’m planning to release a major demo update before September 10, adding a few new features and plenty of improvements to game feel, performance, and existing systems.Please note: existing saves won’t be compatible with the updated demo. You’ll need to start a new save after updating.If you’re in the middle of a playthrough, you may want to wrap it up before the update arrives, or take a break and start fresh once it’s live.I’ll share the full details when the update goes live. Thanks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T15:04:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453341","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4971710-1841579228677843","game_id":"steam-4971710","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.1.4","summary":"Demo Update v0.1.4 is now available!Fixes:• Checkout and weighing sessions now resume correctly after leaving the counter.• Windows can now be cleaned from both sides.• Dirt no longer blocks interaction with the Open/Closed sign.Thank you for playing Fruit Store Simulator Demo!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T10:05:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4971710-1840310314353457","game_id":"steam-4971710","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.1.3: A Proper Ending and More Improvements","summary":"Fruit Store Simulator Demo 0.1.3 is now available!This is a small patch focused mainly on polish and bug fixes, with one major addition: a proper ending for the demo.NEW: DEMO ENDING• The maximum store level in the demo is now 15.• After completing your first fruit-cut order, you will receive a new objective to complete three full business days.• Completing all three days will open a final summary of your store, including days operated, customers served, final store level, total revenue, final b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T08:22:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314353457","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4971710-1840310314342230","game_id":"steam-4971710","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Staff, Multiple Save Slots & Improvements","summary":"Hi everyone!A new update for the Fruit Store Simulator Demo is now live.Save CompatibilityExisting saves from the previous demo version will be moved to Save Slot 1 automatically.What’s NewStaff System: Hire, train, and manage employees through FruitOS. Staff can handle checkout and weighing, restock shelves, prepare cut fruit and juice, clean the store, and help stop shoplifters.Multiple Save Slots: Create and manage up to three separate stores, with improved backup recovery and more reliable s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T15:20:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342230","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4971710-1839676055889201","game_id":"steam-4971710","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Shoplifters, New Languages & Improvements","summary":"Hi everyone!A new update for the Fruit Store Simulator Demo is now live.Important Save Compatibility NoticeThis update includes breaking changes, and saves from previous versions may no longer work correctly. We recommend starting a new save. As the demo is still in active development, we cannot always guarantee save compatibility between updates. We apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your understanding.What’s NewShoplifter System: Watch out for suspicious customers and protect your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T19:38:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055889201","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4971710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4971710":"2026-10-26T15:58:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4971710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:16Z"},"4972660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:16Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4971710","app_id":4971710,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","conte